oth authors' affiliations are boxed placeholders. The removed commands are kept in a comment in the statement's file (`sec7_data.tex`) for later items.\n\n**Gate problem for later items:** if the PDF is out of date when the gate runs, its LaTeX step rebuilds it and crashes. pdflatex prints a non-UTF-8 byte (from \"Möhring\") and the gate script fails to decode it. The first run of this session failed that way. Running `make -C paper2/latex` before the gate avoids it, and I recorded this in PROGRESS.md. I did not edit `gate.py`.\n\n**Recorded in PROGRESS.md:**\n- The full old-to-new map of sections, theorems, tables and figures. For example, old Theorem 4.10 is now Theorem 4.8.\n- The review points this closes: change 3 in part, the structure behind change 6, the reordering in change 7, and the appendix moves in change 10.\n- What's left:\n  - The names section still calls itself \"a prior question\" to the equivalences, which now come before it. Item 04 rewords that.\n  - Some Lean remarks are still inside proofs.\n  - Table 1.1 has no verdict column yet.\n\nItem 01 is marked `[x]`, and the count is now 1/11."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":213,"cache_read_input_tokens":198420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":213,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":722,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1323e98e-623f-4534-a362-41a379cbd2ab","uuid":"235f414e-07e7-48fd-94ab-88dbe6758343","timestamp":"2026-10-06T14:30:32.299Z","request_id":"req_011Cfm9J5ZJ3rG7L3S1wmhqc"}
